{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVELY TRANSLATE YOUR FAVOURITE VISUAL NOVEL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/7b5a8faaf2d3cc5dc11eab01f8d4774a.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=1134 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/7b5a8faaf2d3cc5dc11eab01f8d4774a.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/7b5a8faaf2d3cc5dc11eab01f8d4774a.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAZINGLY FAST TRANSLATION</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of not understanding conversations in your favourite games because of language barriers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you're an avid online player just trying to communicate with your teammates, but you're sick of having to constantly copy-paste to a translator or at best guess what they're saying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or.. perhaps all you want to do is enjoy your time &amp; learn a language as you game on into the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRANSLATE MENUS WITH EASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/a59b693559af36d9c6afac8eb099561a.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=500 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/a59b693559af36d9c6afac8eb099561a.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/a59b693559af36d9c6afac8eb099561a.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this app because I love learning new languages and because games are the reason I can communicate fluently in English today. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also believe the gaming community lacks the tools to communicate efficiently when there are language barriers online. Which, let's be honest, happens quite often. I hope GameTranslate can relieve some of that pain for us all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>READ YOUR FAVOURITE MANGAS AND COMICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/98055940cc8e7ac193225e694225fe02.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=950 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/98055940cc8e7ac193225e694225fe02.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/98055940cc8e7ac193225e694225fe02.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANY LANGUAGES TO CHOOSE FROM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/f89f0387d5e23d11cc93cc3fd825f5a2.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=624 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/f89f0387d5e23d11cc93cc3fd825f5a2.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/f89f0387d5e23d11cc93cc3fd825f5a2.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blazingly fast in-game translation at your disposal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time translations with the 'Automatic' mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borderless, windowed and desktop modes supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ language pairs (..and more coming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attached mode supports any game that can run in windowed mode, and\u00a0<i>most</i> games that run in borderless fullscreen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desktop mode supports\u00a0translation of any text on your desktop, such as your browser, Discord, documents, etcetera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The internal mode supports fullscreen games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translate your favourite comics and manga with the comic mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translate your Visual Novels with an immersive typewriter effect in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works offline!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2274030?t=1763307064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/6ca7066e274e20be8eb3b1b7cb08df9fe08c1455/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763307064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/f35fb7fd2c6a21de6ca64164870a014650db7569/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763307064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/f35fb7fd2c6a21de6ca64164870a014650db7569/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763307064","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2464370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVELY TRANSLATE YOUR FAVOURITE VISUAL NOVEL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/7b5a8faaf2d3cc5dc11eab01f8d4774a.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=1134 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/7b5a8faaf2d3cc5dc11eab01f8d4774a.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/7b5a8faaf2d3cc5dc11eab01f8d4774a.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAZINGLY FAST TRANSLATION</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of not understanding conversations in your favourite games because of language barriers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you're an avid online player just trying to communicate with your teammates, but you're sick of having to constantly copy-paste to a translator or at best guess what they're saying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or.. perhaps all you want to do is enjoy your time &amp; learn a language as you game on into the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRANSLATE MENUS WITH EASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/a59b693559af36d9c6afac8eb099561a.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=500 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/a59b693559af36d9c6afac8eb099561a.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/a59b693559af36d9c6afac8eb099561a.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this app because I love learning new languages and because games are the reason I can communicate fluently in English today. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also believe the gaming community lacks the tools to communicate efficiently when there are language barriers online. Which, let's be honest, happens quite often. I hope GameTranslate can relieve some of that pain for us all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>READ YOUR FAVOURITE MANGAS AND COMICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/98055940cc8e7ac193225e694225fe02.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=950 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/98055940cc8e7ac193225e694225fe02.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/98055940cc8e7ac193225e694225fe02.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANY LANGUAGES TO CHOOSE FROM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/f89f0387d5e23d11cc93cc3fd825f5a2.poster.avif?t=1763307064\" width=624 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/f89f0387d5e23d11cc93cc3fd825f5a2.webm?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/extras/f89f0387d5e23d11cc93cc3fd825f5a2.mp4?t=1763307064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blazingly fast in-game translation at your disposal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time translations with the 'Automatic' mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borderless, windowed and desktop modes supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ language pairs (..and more coming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attached mode supports any game that can run in windowed mode, and\u00a0<i>most</i> games that run in borderless fullscreen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desktop mode supports\u00a0translation of any text on your desktop, such as your browser, Discord, documents, etcetera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The internal mode supports fullscreen games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translate your favourite comics and manga with the comic mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translate your Visual Novels with an immersive typewriter effect in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works offline!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Godnoken"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274030/0c54343bb313adf4e8943b8b9d1a4fd821118689/header.jpg?t=1763307064","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2022-2025 Godnoken. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: